# ============================================================
# Activity Weather – Root Environment Variables
# ============================================================
# The Stormglass API key is now managed by the backend server.
# There are no frontend-only secrets required here.
#
# To configure the backend, copy server/.env.example to server/.env
# and fill in your values:
#
#   cp server/.env.example server/.env
#
# Required backend variables (see server/.env.example for full details):
#
#   STORMGLASS_API_KEY=your_stormglass_api_key_here
#   PORT=3001
#   DB_PATH=./data/activity-weather.sqlite
# ============================================================
